; The export list of amdhip64.dll for step 2 of M16 (design docs/design/m16-hip-route-b.md,
; section 4.1). One name per line, no decoration: every HIP entry point is extern "C", so the
; exported name equals the C name on x64 Windows.
;
; 55 names in three groups:
;   38 HIP entry points of step 2;
;   13 more that llama.cpp's ggml-hip backend adds (step 3, design section 4.9), plus two that the
;     first inventory of step 3 counted among the CUDA-only names by mistake, both found by
;     building that backend:
;       hipOccupancyMaxActiveBlocksPerMultiprocessor - the flash attention path reaches it through
;         a rename (ggml/src/ggml-cuda/fattn-common.cuh:1137), and that file is compiled even when
;         GGML_CUDA_FA is off;
;       hipStreamBeginCapture - ggml-cuda.cu:4598 calls it outside that file's own USE_CUDA_GRAPH
;         guard, so the name has to exist even in a build with no graph support. It says no;
;   2 counter calls of hip_perf.cpp, which are ours and not HIP (hip/hip_runtime.h says why).
; build-runtime.ps1 counts them, and it compares this list with the exports of the built DLL. The
; import library amdhip64.lib comes from this file through llvm-dlltool, and its name must be
; exactly amdhip64.lib, because clang's HIP driver appends that name to the Windows link line by
; itself.
LIBRARY amdhip64.dll
EXPORTS
bc250hipGetCounters
bc250hipResetCounters
__hipPopCallConfiguration
__hipPushCallConfiguration
__hipRegisterFatBinary
__hipRegisterFunction
__hipRegisterManagedVar
__hipRegisterVar
__hipUnregisterFatBinary
hipDeviceCanAccessPeer
hipDeviceEnablePeerAccess
hipDeviceGetAttribute
hipDeviceGetPCIBusId
hipDeviceSynchronize
hipEventCreate
hipEventCreateWithFlags
hipEventDestroy
hipEventElapsedTime
hipEventRecord
hipEventSynchronize
hipFree
hipFuncSetAttribute
hipGetDevice
hipGetDeviceCount
hipGetDeviceProperties
hipGetErrorName
hipGetErrorString
hipGetLastError
hipHostFree
hipHostGetDevicePointer
hipHostMalloc
hipHostRegister
hipHostUnregister
hipInit
hipLaunchCooperativeKernel
hipLaunchKernel
hipMalloc
hipMallocManaged
hipMemAdvise
hipMemGetInfo
hipMemcpy
hipMemcpy2DAsync
hipMemcpyAsync
hipMemcpyPeerAsync
hipMemset
hipMemsetAsync
hipOccupancyMaxActiveBlocksPerMultiprocessor
hipPeekAtLastError
hipSetDevice
hipStreamBeginCapture
hipStreamCreate
hipStreamCreateWithFlags
hipStreamDestroy
hipStreamSynchronize
hipStreamWaitEvent
